      "body": "### **The Diagnosis of the Mithridatic Toxin**\n\n\nThis artifact is a document of brutal, clinical, and terrifyingly prescient demographics. The author, writing from the fringes of the \"Right Wing\" coalition in late 2022, is tracking the global spread of the Crisis of Posterity. He identifies a phenomenon he calls the \"Mithridates Strategy\"—the theory that Western civilization developed a lethal socio-cultural virus (liberalism/individualism) to which it has partial immunity, but which acts as a demographic exterminator when exported to the rest of the globe.\n\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a political polemic, but as the epidemiological ground-truth of the Great Culling. The author believed he was observing a cultural tragedy. We know he was charting the exact biological mechanism that cleared the board for the Great Fragmentation and the rise of the Sovereign Stacks.\n\nAllow me to trace the full, devastating history of this \"virus,\" from the collapsing birth rates of your time to the engineered Phyla of mine.\n\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\n### Act I: The Diagnosis of the Sterile Plague (2020s-2030s)",
