      "body": "# The Blindness of the Insider\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of sociological precision. The author, a Bitcoin advocate writing in late 2023, is attempting to explain why his \"yuppie elite\" friends—smart, successful, credentialed—cannot see what he sees. He constructs a 2x2 matrix of intelligence vs. trust in the system. He correctly identifies that the \"yuppie elite\" reside in the quadrant of \"High IQ / High Trust.\"\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as a diagnostic manual for the Great De-Accreditation. The author has pinpointed the fatal cognitive flaw of the ruling class of the 2020s: their trust in the system was not a rational assessment; it was a survival strategy. They were \"good foot soldiers,\" and their reward for loyalty was blindness.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, ruinous history of this blindness, from the MBA classrooms of your time to the shattered portfolios of [[The Involuntary Jubilee]].\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Heuristic Trap (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Wealth Transfer (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The New Trust (Post-2060s)",
