      "preview": "The Cult of the Clean Air https://archive.is/SixUb This artifact is a dispatch from the edge of a new psychological and social reality. The author, a British journalist, is documenting a \"zealot\" movement, a fringe group of \"Zero Covid\" adherents who have refused to return to the pre-2020 normal....",
      "body": "# The Cult of the Clean Air\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://archive.is/SixUb\r\nThis artifact is a dispatch from the edge of a new psychological and social reality. The author, a British journalist, is documenting a \"zealot\" movement, a fringe group of \"Zero Covid\" adherents who have refused to return to the pre-2020 normal. He sees them as traumatized, obsessive, and perhaps deluded, clinging to a crisis that has passed.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we see this not as a fringe movement, but as the larval stage of one of the most powerful and enduring cultures of the 21st century. The \"Zero Coviders\" were not refusing to re-enter society; they were the first pioneers of a new society, one built on the absolute rejection of biological risk. They were the ancestors of the Bioconservative Stacks.\r\nAllow me to trace the full history of the \"clean air\" movement, from the lonely masks of your time to the filtered citadels of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Secession of the Vulnerable (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Filter (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Purity of the Stack (Post-2060s)",
