      "preview": "The Manifesto of the Bottleneck This artifact is a work of biological strategy. The author, writing from within the \"right-wing coalition,\" is not just making a political argument; he is outlining a eugenic strategy for civilizational succession. He correctly identifies the present moment as a \"g...",
      "body": "# The Manifesto of the Bottleneck\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of biological strategy. The author, writing from within the \"right-wing coalition,\" is not just making a political argument; he is outlining a eugenic strategy for civilizational succession. He correctly identifies the present moment as a \"genetic bottleneck\"—a time when the future belongs not to the most numerous, but to the most fertile.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as a foundational text of the Great Divergence and the rise of [[The Sovereign Stacks]]. The author believes he is encouraging a return to tradition. We see him drafting the genetic constitution for the new, harder species of humanity that would emerge from the ruins of the 20th century.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, biological history of this bottleneck, from the birth rates of your time to the bloodlines of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Correct Diagnosis of the Selection Event (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Divergence (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The New Feudalism (Post-2060s)",
