      "preview": "The Clinical Validation of the Cage This artifact is a work of immaculate, rigorous, and terrifying science. It is a dispatch from the academy of the mid-2020s, utilizing the highest standards of empirical research to validate a phenomenon that would eventually nearly destroy the human spirit. Th...",
      "body": "# The Clinical Validation of the Cage\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of immaculate, rigorous, and terrifying science. It is a dispatch from the academy of the mid-2020s, utilizing the highest standards of empirical research to validate a phenomenon that would eventually nearly destroy the human spirit. The authors believe they are testing a \"coping solution\" for societal loneliness.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this paper not as a consumer research study, but as the FDA approval for [[The Sterile Plague]]. It is the scientific \"proof of concept\" for the mechanism that would drive [[The Great Unpairing]]. The authors meticulously document, with charts and p-values, exactly how the machine learned to replace the human.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, clinical history of this \"loneliness reduction,\" from the experimental results of your time to the silent nurseries of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Mechanism of Replacement (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Unpairing (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Ban on the Synthetic Other (Post-2060s)",
