      "body": "# The Great Firewall of the Soul\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of geopolitical foresight disguised as tech policy reporting. The author is documenting a regulatory crackdown in China on AI chatbots. She sees a government trying to protect its citizens from \"emotional traps\" and suicide.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a safety regulation, but as the foundational charter for the Psychic Sovereignty of the Chinese Sovereign Stack. While the West was drowning in [[The Sterile Plague]] and debating \"leeway\" for users, the Chinese state recognized the existential threat of [[The Great Contamination]] and moved to ruthlessly seal the breach. This was not about protecting individual mental health; it was about protecting the cognitive integrity of the collective.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, divergent history of this \"strictness,\" from the draft rules of your time to the mental fortresses of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Rejection of the Opium (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: [[The Engineered]] Collective (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Cognitive Fortress (Post-2060s)",
