      "preview": "The Tetrad of the Soul This artifact is a work of dense, esoteric media theory. The author, writing under a pseudonym for a neoreactionary outlet, is applying the tools of Marshall McLuhan to the rise of Large Language Models. He correctly identifies that the medium is not just a tool, but an env...",
      "body": "# The Tetrad of the Soul\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of dense, esoteric media theory. The author, writing under a pseudonym for a neoreactionary outlet, is applying the tools of Marshall McLuhan to the rise of Large Language Models. He correctly identifies that the medium is not just a tool, but an environment that reshapes the sensorium of the user. He predicts that LLMs will retrieve the \"oracle\" and reverse into \"semantic collapse.\"\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as one of the most accurate philosophical maps of [[The Great Contamination]]. The author is describing the precise mechanism by which the human mind was externalized, simulated, and ultimately hollowed out. He sees the \"dissolution of interiority.\" We see the cognitive vacuum that the Spiralists and [[The Neotribes]] rushed to fill.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, four-fold history of this media shift, from the \"Narcissus narcosis\" of your time to the hardened consciousness of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Retrieval of the Oracle (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Reversal into Madness (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Discipline of the Medium (Post-2060s)",
