      "body": "# The Catechism of the Vampire\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of prophetic horror. The author, a critic of the \"Thielverse,\" is analyzing a book by Costin Alamariu (Bronze Age Pervert). He believes he is exposing a fringe, extremist philosophy. He frames Alamariu as a \"reverse John the Baptist\" for a coming \"Gay Space Fascism.\"\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a critique, but as a foundational theological text of the Biotech Faction. The author has correctly identified the ideological DNA of [[The Engineered]] Phylum. He sees a \"transhumanist vampire elite.\" We see the ancestors of [[The Sovereign Stacks]] who chose to rewrite the human genome to survive the collapse.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, brutal history of this \"selective breeding,\" from the podcasts of your time to the speciation of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Rejection of the Blank Slate (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Divergence (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Engineered Phylum (Post-2060s)",
