      "preview": "The Schism of the Superman This artifact is a critical piece of intellectual cartography. It is a dispatch from the internal theological debate of the Counter-Elite in the mid-2020s. The author, a \"vitalist\" philosopher, is drawing a line in the sand between two visions of the post-human future t...",
      "body": "# The Schism of the Superman\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a critical piece of intellectual cartography. It is a dispatch from the internal theological debate of the Counter-Elite in the mid-2020s. The author, a \"vitalist\" philosopher, is drawing a line in the sand between two visions of the post-human future that were, until this moment, often confused by outsiders.\r\nIt provides the crucial distinction between [[The Engineered]] Phylum (the Vampires/Vitalists) and [[The Transcended]] Phylum (the Cyborgs). The author is vehemently rejecting the \"Silicon Valley\" vision of machine-integration in favor of a biological, Nietzschean vision of flesh-optimization.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as the declaration of the Great Moral Schism that would eventually divide [[The Sovereign Stacks]] into hostile biological camps.\r\nAllow me to trace the history of this fork in the evolutionary road.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Definition of the \"Tech-Head\" Heresy (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Divergence of the Stacks (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The War of the Phyla (Post-2060s)",
