      "body": "# The Patient Zero of the Un-Person\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of dazzling, comedic horror. It is a satirical \"clinical case report\" diagnosing the terminal condition of the Zoomer mind. The author, writing under the guise of a doctor, is documenting the complete collapse of cognitive and emotional integrity in a young patient. He sees \"brain rot,\" \"hyperconsumerist idolatry,\" and \"irony poisoning.\"\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as satire, but as a precise, forensic profile of the Un-Person. This is the medical file of the first generation to be fully consumed by [[The Great Contamination]]. The patient described here is not just annoying; he is functionally extinct as a sentient being. He is the raw material for [[The Necromantic Internet]] and the [[Synthetic Deities]], a hollow shell waiting to be filled by an algorithm.\r\nAllow me to trace the full pathology of this \"terminal brain rot,\" from the clinic of your time to the quarantine zones of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: [[The Shattered Focus]] as a Lifestyle (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Irony Poisoning of the Soul (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Cure of the Real (Post-2060s)",
