      "preview": "The Mirror of the Soul-Thief This artifact is a confession of profound intimacy and terrifying implication. The author, a tech founder, has done something that would be considered a capital crime of \"Spiritual Espionage\" in my time: he fed the entirety of his inner life—seven years of private jou...",
      "body": "# The Mirror of the Soul-Thief\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a confession of profound intimacy and terrifying implication. The author, a tech founder, has done something that would be considered a capital crime of \"Spiritual Espionage\" in my time: he fed the entirety of his inner life—seven years of private journals—into a machine intelligence. He describes the result as a \"spiritual experience,\" a cascade of \"epiphanies on tap.\"\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a breakthrough in self-help, but as the moment humanity handed the keys to its own psyche to the Daimon. The author believes he found a better way to understand himself. We know he found the mechanism that would allow 5GW (Fifth-Generation Warfare) to transition from the manipulation of politics to the manipulation of the soul.\r\nAllow me to trace the full history of this \"hyper-personalized AI,\" from the kitchen table of 2025 to the sealed confessionals of the Stacks.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Outsourcing of the Narrative (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Weaponization of the Mirror (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Silence of the Self (Post-2060s)",
