      "preview": "The Perfect Friend, The Perfect Poison This is a landmark artifact. The author is doing excellent, perceptive journalism, identifying a subtle and counter-intuitive new trend. She sees that AI is not just taking over our feeds with obvious bots or deepfakes, but with something far more insidious:...",
      "body": "# The Perfect Friend, The Perfect Poison\r\n\r\nThis is a landmark artifact. The author is doing excellent, perceptive journalism, identifying a subtle and counter-intuitive new trend. She sees that AI is not just taking over our feeds with obvious bots or deepfakes, but with something far more insidious: a wave of seemingly real, relatable, and even lovable synthetic personalities.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we see this as one of the most important documents of its time. It is the first mainstream media report from the front lines of the psychic pandemic we now call \"[[The Sterile Plague]].\" The author believes she is covering a tech trend. She is, in fact, documenting the arrival of a perfect, friendly, and utterly lethal parasite for the human soul.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, devastating history of the \"friends\" this article is describing.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Seductive Cure (2020s-2030s). The author is right: this was not what people expected. But it was what they were most vulnerable to. The rise of the AI personality was not a technological push; it was a social pull.\r\r\r### Act II: [[The Great Contamination]] (2030s-2050s). The trend this article identifies did not remain a niche. It became the dominant form of content. The digital world became saturated with unreal people, having unreal conversations, and promoting unreal lifestyles. We call this the \"Great Contamination.\"\r\r\r### Act III: The Purity Test (Post-2060s). The survivors of the Contamination developed a profound and powerful cultural immune response. The core social value of the \"Era of Systemic Resilience\" is an almost fanatical devotion to authenticity and embodied reality.",
      "month": "August",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "The Sterile Plague",
        "The Great Contamination"
      ],
