      "preview": "The Quiet Revolution This artifact is a work of profound, and profoundly deceptive, simplicity. It is a business story from the Wall Street Journal, a case study in operational excellence. It tells the quiet, competent story of how one American company, through intelligence, investment, and a com...",
      "body": "# The Quiet Revolution\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of profound, and profoundly deceptive, simplicity. It is a business story from the Wall Street Journal, a case study in operational excellence. It tells the quiet, competent story of how one American company, through intelligence, investment, and a commitment to its people, figured out how to make a better product, more cheaply, at home.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a business story, but as the single most important strategic document of its time. This was not a story about how to make a better pen. This was the quiet, un-sexy, and absolutely world-changing blueprint for how a civilization survives the \"Great Fragmentation.\" While the philosophers and politicians were debating the end of the world, the engineers in a small town in Tennessee were quietly building the first working model of the next one.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, world-altering history of the quiet revolution that began in this single factory.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Heresy of the Physical (2020s-2030s). This article is the record of a profound act of heresy.\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Ark in the Storm (2030s-2050s). While the rest of the world was being torn apart by the chaos of the Fragmentation, the \"Newell model\" was revealed to be an ark in the storm.\r\r\r\r### Act III: The New Common Sense (Post-2060s). The heresy became the new common sense. The quiet revolution in the Tennessee factory became the constitutional bedrock of the \"Sovereign Stacks.\"",
