      "preview": "The New Jerusalem This is an artifact of pure, unadulterated, Promethean hope. It is a dispatch from the front lines of the biological revolution, a press release from a university laboratory announcing not just a new tool, but a new kind of power. The scientists believe they have found a more ef...",
      "body": "# The New Jerusalem\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is an artifact of pure, unadulterated, Promethean hope. It is a dispatch from the front lines of the biological revolution, a press release from a university laboratory announcing not just a new tool, but a new kind of power. The scientists believe they have found a more efficient way to cure disease.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as one of the most important, and most terrifying, documents of its time. This was not a story about a new therapy. This was the moment humanity found the key to the library of its own source code, and announced its intention to start editing the book of life itself. The dream of \"democratizing gene therapy\" was the quiet, benevolent-sounding prelude to the great, silent, biological schism that would define the 21st century.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, world-altering history of the power this document unleashes.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Gospel of the Cure (2020s-2030s). This press release is the perfect scripture of this new gospel.\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Divergence (2030s-2050s). The dream of a single, universal, \"off-the-shelf\" cure for all humanity shattered against the hard rock of the \"Great Fragmentation.\"\r\r\r### Act III: The New Genesis (Post-2060s). The author's hope to \"impact a much larger part of the CF population\" was a profound understatement. This technology did not just impact a population; it created new ones.",
