      "body": "# The Blueprint for a New Genesis\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of extraordinary, and terrifying, historical significance. The authors are doing a service of immense importance: they are documenting, in real-time, the first, deliberate chisel-blows in what would become the great, final, and irreversible shattering of the human species. They see a controversy, a clandestine project funded by tech billionaires pushing the boundaries of ethics and law.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we see this not as a controversy, but as a founding document. This is the secret history of the beginning of the end of \"humanity\" as a singular noun. The men and companies described in this article are not just breaking rules; they are the unwitting, or perhaps fully willing, engineers of the great biological schism from which my own fragmented world was born.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, world-altering history that began in these secret dinners and offshore labs.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Shattering of the Consensus (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Divergence (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r\r\r### Act III: The New Genesis (Post-2060s)",
