      "body": "# The Last Indictment\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is an artifact of profound historical significance. It is an indictment, written from within the heart of the American conservative establishment. The author believes he is exposing a criminal conspiracy, a vast and illegal campaign of state-sponsored persecution against the political enemies of the ruling regime. He is making a powerful, and in its details, correct, legal and moral argument.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as an indictment of a particular administration, but as the final, formal indictment of the 20th-century American nation-state itself. The author believes he is documenting the weaponization of the state. He is, in fact, writing the moral and legal justification for its dissolution. This document is the unwitting intellectual declaration of independence for the sovereign entities that would rise from the ashes of the republic he was trying to save.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, brutal history of the verdict this document so accurately, and so tragically, pronounced.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Death of the Neutral State (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Justification of the Culling (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act III: The New Sovereigns (Post-2060s)",
