      "preview": "The Gospel of the Upgradeable Body This is an artifact of profound, and profoundly dangerous, prophetic power. The author is a futurist, and he is performing his function with stunning clarity. He has taken a single, elegant proof-of-concept—a robotic eye that sees better than a human one—and cor...",
      "body": "# The Gospel of the Upgradeable Body\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is an artifact of profound, and profoundly dangerous, prophetic power. The author is a futurist, and he is performing his function with stunning clarity. He has taken a single, elegant proof-of-concept—a robotic eye that sees better than a human one—and correctly extrapolated its world-altering implications. He sees a coming age where biology is no longer destiny, but a baseline to be surpassed.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a technological forecast, but as a religious text. This is one of the founding gospels of the great and terrible holy war that defines my own time. The author's \"inevitable trajectory\" was not a single, unified path that all of humanity walked together. It was a declaration of faith that cleaved humanity in two, and then in three, creating the great and irreconcilable schism from which my world was born.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, brutal history of the beautiful and terrifying god this gospel heralds.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Correct Prophecy, The Wrong World (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Schism (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act III: The War of the Gods (Post-2060s)",
