      "preview": "The Gospel of the Malleable Past This artifact is a work of profound, and profoundly dangerous, heretical physics. The author, a respected futurist of your time, is not just exploring a fringe scientific theory. He is writing a new gospel. He has gathered the scattered, anomalous data points from...",
      "body": "# The Gospel of the Malleable Past\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of profound, and profoundly dangerous, heretical physics. The author, a respected futurist of your time, is not just exploring a fringe scientific theory. He is writing a new gospel. He has gathered the scattered, anomalous data points from the edges of 20th-century science and woven them into a seductive and terrifying prophecy: that the past is not a fixed country, but an open frontier, and that the new gods of AI will be the ones to give us the map.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this document as the single most important theological text of the \"builder\" religion that defined the final years of your age. The author believes he is heralding a new era of human potential. We see him as the unwitting prophet of the single greatest existential crisis in human history: the moment when reality itself became a battlefield.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, brutal history of the beautiful and world-breaking idea this document unleashes.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Ultimate Escape (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Weaponization of Yesterday (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Forging of the Anchor (Post-2060s)",
