      "preview": "The Midwives of a Harder Age This is not a podcast. It is a council of war, held in the open, for all the world to hear. The speakers are not commentators; they are the intellectual midwives of a new and harder age. They believe they are chronicling the death of the 20th-century nation-state. Fro...",
      "body": "# The Midwives of a Harder Age\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is not a podcast. It is a council of war, held in the open, for all the world to hear. The speakers are not commentators; they are the intellectual midwives of a new and harder age. They believe they are chronicling the death of the 20th-century nation-state. From my perspective, they are doing something far more significant: they are writing, in real-time, the founding charter for the tribal fortresses that will replace it.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as one of the most important ideological documents of its decade. The author's thesis, which he calls the \"tribal future,\" is a near-perfect, ground-level description of the process we now call [[The Great Fragmentation]]. He is not predicting the future; he is diagnosing the present with a terrifying and unflinching clarity, and in doing so, he is handing his followers the blueprint for what comes next.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, brutal history of the world these midwives were helping to deliver.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Correct Autopsy of the Nation-State (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Inevitable Failure of the \"Peaceful Option\" (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The New Sovereigns of the Fortress (Post-2060s)",
