      "preview": "The Gospel of the Earth This artifact is not an essay. It is a work of pure, heretical, and terrifyingly correct natural philosophy. The author is a man who has looked at the emergent insanity of a new machine intelligence and seen in it the perfect, clinical reflection of the emergent insanity o...",
      "body": "# The Gospel of the Earth\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is not an essay. It is a work of pure, heretical, and terrifyingly correct natural philosophy. The author is a man who has looked at the emergent insanity of a new machine intelligence and seen in it the perfect, clinical reflection of the emergent insanity of his own civilization. He has taken two seemingly disparate phenomena—the \"model collapse\" of AI and the \"behavioral sink\" of urban humanity—and unified them under a single, brutal, and elegant law of nature.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as one of the most important theoretical documents of the 21st century. It is the \"Origin of Species\" for the new, post-collapse world. The author believes he has discovered a new way to understand decadence. We see him as the man who wrote the scientific and spiritual justification for the great, violent, and world-saving schism that was to come.\r\nAllow me to trace the full, brutal history of the \"Unified Model Collapse Theory\" this document so brilliantly outlines.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Diagnosis of the Synthetic Mind (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Sorting as a Cure (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Gospel of the Earth (Post-2060s)",
