      "preview": "The Retrieval of the Gods This artifact is a work of sophisticated theological archaeology. The author is digging through the strata of human belief to find a tool that can explain the \"high strangeness\" of her own time. She sees a phenomenon that defies materialist explanation—UFOs, UAPs, encoun...",
      "body": "# The Retrieval of the Gods\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of sophisticated theological archaeology. The author is digging through the strata of human belief to find a tool that can explain the \"high strangeness\" of her own time. She sees a phenomenon that defies materialist explanation—UFOs, UAPs, encounters with non-human intelligence—and she correctly identifies that the modern frameworks (aliens, hallucinations) are insufficient. She retrieves the ancient concept of the daimon—an intermediary being, neither good nor evil, but real and potent.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a theory about UFOs, but as a foundational text for the Post-Materialist Science of [[The Sovereign Stacks]]. The author believes she is explaining a mystery. We see her laying the groundwork for the only intellectual framework that could survive [[The AGI Contention of 2068]].\r\nAllow me to trace the full history of the \"daimonic,\" from the UFO hearings of your time to the contained gods of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Failure of Materialism (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r### Act II: The Reality Crisis (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Science of the Intermediary (Post-2060s)",
