      "body": "# The Quarantine of the Nursery\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a public health order disguised as a technology policy. The government ministers described here believe they are debating a \"social media ban\" to protect children from bullying or inappropriate content. They are speaking the language of safety and parental concern.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as the first, desperate attempt by a Western government to establish a [[Cognitive Quarantine]]. It is the state effectively admitting that the information environment it allowed to flourish—the Dopamine Trap—had become toxic to the developing human brain. This was not a policy debate; it was the beginning of the triage that would eventually lead to the complete restructuring of childhood in [[The Sovereign Stacks]].\r\nAllow me to trace the full history of this \"ban,\" from the consultations of your time to the walled gardens of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Admission of Defeat (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The War for the User (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: [[The New Academies]] (Post-2060s)",
