      "preview": "Herald of the Patchwork Era This is not a podcast about political theory. It is an autopsy performed while the patient was still convinced they were merely suffering from a common cold. From my perspective in 2100, we read Mike Maxwell’s words as a \"pre-echo\" of the reality we inhabit. He was one...",
      "body": "# Herald of the Patchwork Era\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is not a podcast about political theory. It is an autopsy performed while the patient was still convinced they were merely suffering from a common cold.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read Mike Maxwell’s words as a \"pre-echo\" of the reality we inhabit. He was one of the few in your era who looked at the crumbling of the 20th-century facade and saw not just \"chaos,\" but the emergence of a new (and very old) physics of power. The \"Tribal Future\" he describes is the bedrock upon which my world, the Era of Systemic Resilience, was built.\r\nAllow me to trace the trajectory of this devolutionary arc, viewed through the Hindsight Filter.\r### Act I: [[The Age of Institutional Exhaustion]] (2020s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Great Schism and [[The Parasovereigns]] (2030s – 2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Era of Systemic Resilience (Post-2060s)",
