      "body": "# The Exodus of the Architects\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of high-stakes, insider journalism. It is a dispatch from the panicked group chats of the \"Builder Tribe,\" documenting the moment the richest men in the world decided to leave the state that created them. The author, Mike Solana, is chronicling the \"wealth flight\" triggered by a proposed asset seizure law in California.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a tax story, but as the logistical prelude to [[The Great Physical Sorting]]. The author sees billionaires fleeing a \"leopards eating faces\" situation. We see the architects of the future packing their bags and taking the blueprints for [[The Sovereign Stacks]] with them.\r\nAllow me to trace the full history of this exodus, from the real estate listings of 2026 to the fortified borders of my time.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Host Becomes Hostile (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Capital Strike (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The New Sovereignty (Post-2060s)",
