      "preview": "The Obituary of the Witness This artifact is a dispatch from the temporal front lines of the Great De-Accreditation. The author, a military war gamer, is performing a forensic analysis on the death of journalism. He correctly identifies that the failure of the media was not primarily moral (bias)...",
      "body": "# The Obituary of the Witness\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a dispatch from the temporal front lines of the Great De-Accreditation. The author, a military war gamer, is performing a forensic analysis on the death of journalism. He correctly identifies that the failure of the media was not primarily moral (bias), but structural (speed). He sees an institution built for a \"sequential\" world trying to function in a \"continuous\" one, and failing to metabolize the data fast enough to remain relevant.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as the definitive explanation for why the \"Fourth Estate\" did not survive the transition. Journalism died of lag. It was an analog watchman trying to track a digital swarm.\r\nAllow me to trace the history of this \"acceleration trap,\" from the newsrooms of your time to the immutable ledgers of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Gap in the OODA Loop (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Swarm Overwhelms the Scribe (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Automated Truth (Post-2060s)",
