      "body": "# The Architecture of Inheritance\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of architectural eugenics. The author, a British writer, is proposing a radical solution to [[The Crisis of Posterity]]. He suggests that billionaires bypass the state and directly fund the reproduction of \"high human capital\" individuals by creating subsidized housing enclaves. He calls them \"Grok Hives,\" a term rooted in the slang of his era, but the structure he proposes is far older and more enduring.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as a founding document of [[The Sovereign Stacks]]. The author believes he is pitching a philanthropic project. We see him drafting the social contract for the New Feudalism. The \"Hives\" were the prototype for the reproductive logistics of the post-collapse world, where housing, resources, and status are directly tied to the biological production of the next generation.\r\nAllow me to trace the full history of this \"hive\" model, from the Substack proposal of your time to the fortified nurseries of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Failure of the Abstract Bribe (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Rise of [[The Männerbund]] (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: [[The First Ascendants]] (Post-2060s)",
