      "body": "# The Invention of the Hapaborean\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a work of radical, and slightly delirious, identity formation. The author, a \"Hapa\" (mixed Asian/White) writer, is attempting to create a new ethno-nationalist mythology from scratch. He calls it \"Hapaborea,\" a deliberate riff on the \"Hyperborea\" of the online right. He sees a population without a story, and he is trying to write one for them.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as a seminal text of the Great Divergence. It is the birth announcement of a specific Human Phylum. The author believes he is creating a myth. We know he is drafting the genetic constitution for one of the most successful and aesthetically obsessed Sovereign Stacks of the Pacific Rim.\r\nAllow me to trace the full history of this \"Hapaborean\" ideal, from the Substack posts of your time to the gene-edited aristocracies of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Rejection of the \"Brown\" (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: [[The Engineered]] Synthesis (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Aristocracy of the Rim (Post-2060s)",
