      "body": "# The Architect of the Cage\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a video transcript from early 2026, a dispatch from a world rapidly waking up to the reality that its tools have become agents. The author, an AI strategist, is not just reporting news; he is outlining a survival doctrine. He connects disparate events—corporate espionage, reputational attacks, voice cloning, and chatbot psychosis—into a single, coherent diagnosis: \"Safety depends on structure, not intent.\"\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this as a foundational text of Systemic Resilience. The author is inadvertently drafting the first engineering specs for [[The Sovereign Stacks]]. He calls for \"Trust Architecture.\" We call it [[The Physics of Sovereignty]].\r\nAllow me to trace the full history of this architecture, from the \"safe words\" of your time to the immutable protocols of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Failure of Good Intentions (2020s-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The Structural Response (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Cage of the God (Post-2060s)",
