      "body": "# The Monetization of the Fog\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis artifact is a balance sheet for the end of shared reality. The authors, strategic intelligence analysts, are quantifying the \"economic impact\" of lies. They calculate that AI-driven disinformation cost the global economy $26 billion in 2024. They see this as a \"risk\" to be managed with better detection software.\r\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a risk assessment, but as the first quarterly report of [[The Grey Fog]]. The authors correctly identified that information had become a weapon. What they missed was that the weapon was not being used to steal money; it was being used to destroy the concept of value itself. The \"industrialization of disinformation\" was the mechanism that severed the link between price and reality, leading directly to [[The Involuntary Jubilee]].\r\nAllow me to trace the full, hallucinatory history of this \"$26 billion threat,\" from the algo-trading bots of your time to the immutable ledgers of mine.\r\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\r### Act I: The Algorithmic Hallucination (2026-2030s)\r\r\r\r### Act II: The War of the False Flag (2030s-2050s)\r\r\r\r### Act III: The Truth You Pay For (Post-2060s)",
