      "body": "### **The Architecture of the Velvet Cage**\n\n\nThis artifact is a document of breathtaking imperial ambition, draped in the soothing, bureaucratic language of public service. The authors—the executives of a massive corporate Parasovereign in 2026—are not asking for permission to build a god; they are politely informing the nation-state that the god is arriving, and offering to help draft the surrender documents. They frame this \"Industrial Policy\" as a way to \"keep people first.\"\n\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a policy proposal, but as the foundational charter of the corporate techno-state. It is the moment the architects of the AI Energy Wall realized the physical and political consequences of their creation, and moved preemptively to capture the regulatory apparatus that might otherwise stop them. They foresaw the Great Displacement and the Crisis of Meaning, and proposed to manage the collapse through a system of subsidized dependency and absolute digital surveillance.\n\nAllow me to trace the full, chilling history of this \"transition,\" from the white papers of your time to the hardened protocols of mine.\n\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\n### Act I: The Bribe and the Bypass (2020s-2030s)",
