      "preview": "The Blueprint of the Velvet Hook This artifact is a fascinating piece of geopolitical forensics, delivered through the frantic, highly caffeinated medium of a 2026 YouTube broadcast. The author, a self-styled \"doctor\" and tech commentator, has stumbled upon the exact logistical mechanism that wou...",
      "body": "### **The Blueprint of the Velvet Hook**\n\n\nThis artifact is a fascinating piece of geopolitical forensics, delivered through the frantic, highly caffeinated medium of a 2026 YouTube broadcast. The author, a self-styled \"doctor\" and tech commentator, has stumbled upon the exact logistical mechanism that would trigger the *Great Contamination* and the subsequent *Splinternet*. He is describing \"Token Chuhai\" (the export of AI tokens)—a Chinese state strategy to flood the Western market with heavily subsidized, high-capability AI models. He correctly identifies the goal: data exfiltration at a civilizational scale.\n\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this transcript not as a conspiracy theory, but as the opening operational order for the *Cognitive Supply Chain Wars*. The author believes he is exposing a scam. We know he is describing the final, fatal vulnerability of the \"open web\" before the Sovereign Stacks slammed their firewalls shut.\n\nAllow me to trace the full, invisible history of this data war, from the sponsored YouTube videos of your time to the air-gapped fortresses of mine.\n\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\n### Act I: The Economics of the Trojan Horse (2025-2026)",
