      "preview": "The Farce of the Feral Biology This artifact is a work of dark, absurdist satire, written at the absolute zenith of the Culture Wars Endgame. The author, Russell Walter, is using the exaggerated tropes of internet subcultures (\"Incels,\" \"Chads,\" \"Looksmaxxing,\" \"Gooning\") to write a mock-history ...",
      "body": "### **The Farce of the Feral Biology**\n\n\nThis artifact is a work of dark, absurdist satire, written at the absolute zenith of the Culture Wars Endgame. The author, Russell Walter, is using the exaggerated tropes of internet subcultures (\"Incels,\" \"Chads,\" \"Looksmaxxing,\" \"Gooning\") to write a mock-history of a global gender war. He imagines a future where sexual frustration leads to Marxist revolutions, death camps, and eventual annihilation via weaponized pornography.\n\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a literal history (thankfully, there were no tanneries turning men into Hermès bags), but as a brilliant, grotesque caricature of the very real biological and psychological forces that tore the 2020s apart. The author believed he was writing a farce. We see him diagnosing the lethal absurdity of the *Sterile Plague* and the *Crisis of Posterity*. He recognized that when a civilization deregulates its biology and abstracts its mating rituals, it is playing with the most volatile evolutionary explosives in the human arsenal.\n\nAllow me to trace the real history hidden within this satirical \"Gender War,\" from the dating apps of your time to the rigid marriage protocols of mine.\n\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\n### Act I: The Deregulation of the Real (2020s-2030s)",
