      "body": "### **The Pathology of the Infinite Scroll**\n\n\nThis artifact is a dispatch from the waiting room of a psychiatric ward that encompassed an entire civilization. The author is reporting on a \"landmark trial\" and a flurry of scientific studies confirming what the victims already knew: the digital environment of the 2020s was neurologically toxic. She writes with the optimism of a society that believes it has found a cure in \"digital detoxes\" and legal settlements.\n\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a public health victory, but as the final, tragic diagnosis of the *Shattered Focus*. The science described here—proving that a smartphone could induce ten years of cognitive decline—is the foundational medical text of the *Analog Mandate*. Your era tried to treat the symptom with a \"break.\" We treated the disease by burning down the factory that manufactured it.\n\nAllow me to trace the full, neurological history of this \"brain damage,\" from the courtrooms of your time to the Faraday cages of mine.\n\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\n### Act I: The Diagnosis of the Dopamine Trap (2020s-2030s)",
