      "body": "### **The Ledger of the Cannibal State**\n\n\nThis artifact is a document of terrifying, cold arithmetic. The author, writing in the spring of 2026, is attempting to explain a profound atmospheric dread—the \"malaise\" of the young—using demographic data and fiscal projections. He identifies \"Gerontonomia,\" a political economy optimized entirely for the comfort of the elderly at the expense of the future. He sees a looming crisis of insolvency and proposes \"gentle\" recalibrations.\n\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as an economic analysis, but as the final diagnosis of the *Crisis of Posterity* before it turned kinetic. The author believed he was writing about a generational wealth transfer. We know he was describing the structural autocannibalism of the 20th-century nation-state—a civilization that had legally mandated the consumption of its own young.\n\nAllow me to trace the full, brutal history of this \"gerontocracy,\" from the budget debates of your time to the unforgiving ledgers of mine.\n\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\n### Act I: The Physics of the Ponzi Scheme (2020s-2030s)",
