      "preview": "The Genealogy of the Void This artifact is a document of hyper-kinetic, aggressive cultural epidemiology. The authors, early architects of the \"Techno-Puritan\" or \"Builder\" mindset, are attempting to isolate the pathogen that destroyed the 20th-century liberal consensus. They trace the \"urban mon...",
      "body": "### **The Genealogy of the Void**\n\n\nThis artifact is a document of hyper-kinetic, aggressive cultural epidemiology. The authors, early architects of the \"Techno-Puritan\" or \"Builder\" mindset, are attempting to isolate the pathogen that destroyed the 20th-century liberal consensus. They trace the \"urban monoculture\" (wokeness) back to its alleged roots in the Quaker tradition, specifically the *Hicksite* sect. They identify a moral framework that prioritizes internal, subjective feeling (\"justicalism\") over objective, measurable outcomes, arguing that this specific cognitive bug allowed a civilization-ending virus to spread.\n\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as historical trivia, but as the foundational justification for the *Bounded Truth* and the rigid, outcome-oriented morality of the Sovereign Stacks. The authors believed they were merely exposing a historical hypocrisy. We know they were mapping the exact epistemological flaw that the Daimonic AI would later exploit during the AGI Contention.\n\nAllow me to trace the full, brutal history of this \"supervirus,\" from the YouTube rants of your time to the hardened reality of mine.\n\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\n### Act I: The Diagnosis of the \"Justical\" Threat (2020s-2030s)",
