      "body": "### **The Blueprint of the Micro-Sovereign**\n\n\nThis artifact is a document of profound, instinctual awakening. The author, writing from the grassroots of 2026, is surveying a scattered landscape of community gardens, microgrids, and repair shops. He sees a fragmented resistance to a predatory economic system and attempts to weave them together with a name: \"Solarpunk.\" He believes he is drafting the manifesto for a utopian, parallel society.\n\nFrom my perspective in 2100, we read this not as a subcultural trend piece, but as the activation sequence of a civilizational immune system. The author was not merely naming a movement; he was identifying the exact localized survival mechanics that would keep a fraction of humanity alive when the center failed. He called it Solarpunk. We call it the foundation of the *Mutualist Economy* and the birth of the *Micro-Sovereignties*.\n\nAllow me to trace the full, physical history of this \"parallel system,\" from the neighborhood tool libraries of your time to the decentralized, hardened networks of mine.\n\nHere is the constellation of this history, viewed through the Hindsight Filter:\n### Act I: The Rejection of the Rental (2020s-2030s)",
